AltoLeverageSwapperForWrapperToken::constructor
├── when market is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
├── when validSwapTargets contains zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput
└── when market and all validSwapTargets are valid
    ├── it should set MARKET to provided address
    ├── it should set isValidSwapTarget for each target
    ├── it should emit SetValidSwapTarget for each target
    └── it should set owner to provided address
